#: ../../source/docs/precision-landing-blueos.rst:5
#: edeabb32e9d04bf8b77b996adc7797e2
msgid "BlueOS Precision Landing Extension"
msgstr "BlueOS 精准降落扩展"

#: ../../source/docs/precision-landing-blueos.rst:7
#: a73163a18f1b439790a4989e738c81a7
msgid ""
"`BlueOS's Precision Landing Extension <https://github.com/BlueOS-"
"community/blueos-precision-landing>`__ allows a downward facing camera "
"gimbal to be used to land precisely on a landing pad identified with an "
"April Tag"
msgstr ""
"`BlueOS 的精准降落扩展 <https://github.com/BlueOS-community/blueos-precision-"
"landing>`__ 允许使用朝下的相机云台，在以 April Tag 标识的降落垫上实现精准降落"

#: ../../source/docs/precision-landing-blueos.rst:14
#: 7e61b27fd2d847978138d135ed486472
msgid "Support for this extension was added in ArduPilot-4.7"
msgstr "对该扩展的支持在 ArduPilot-4.7 中加入"

#: ../../source/docs/precision-landing-blueos.rst:17
#: 56eef6da3c994294970d7b036bc33166
msgid "Hardware Required"
msgstr "所需硬件"

#: ../../source/docs/precision-landing-blueos.rst:19
#: d064b60267f04348b8d5a6343de62cad
msgid ""
"Please see :ref:`ArduPilot's BlueOS installation instructions "
"<dev:companion-computer-blueos>` which also includes hardware "
"recommendations."
msgstr ""
"请参阅 :ref:`ArduPilot 的 BlueOS 安装说明 <dev:companion-computer-"
"blueos>`，其中也包含硬件推荐。"

#: ../../source/docs/precision-landing-blueos.rst:21
#: cc517de657124f668a2b6de0138cfe6d
msgid ""
"Any :ref:`supported camera gimbal <common-cameras-and-gimbals>` with "
"ethernet connectivity should work including the :ref:`Siyi <common-siyi-"
"zr10-gimbal>`, :ref:`ViewPro <common-viewpro-gimbal>` and :ref:`XFRobot "
"<common-xfrobot-gimbal>` camera gimbals."
msgstr ""
"任何具备以太网连接的 :ref:`受支持相机云台 <common-cameras-and-gimbals>` 都应该可用，包括 :ref:`Siyi "
"<common-siyi-zr10-gimbal>`、:ref:`ViewPro <common-viewpro-gimbal>` 和 "
":ref:`XFRobot <common-xfrobot-gimbal>` 相机云台。"

#: ../../source/docs/precision-landing-blueos.rst:23
#: 9a46b11de3f64c55b38f0c5ae6391bd8
msgid ""
"The camera gimbal should be mounted on the underside of the vehicle and "
"precision landing will only operate when the camera gimbal is pointing "
"downwards."
msgstr "相机云台应安装在机体底部，且只有当相机云台朝下时精准降落才会工作。"

#: ../../source/docs/precision-landing-blueos.rst:25
#: 70678de019144fb8b7548f36e1b99f4d
msgid ""
"Print an AprilTag for the landing pad.  `This online AprilTag generator "
"<https://chaitanyantr.github.io/apriltag.html>`__ using the \"tag36h11\" tag"
" family has been used successfully."
msgstr ""
"为降落垫打印一个 AprilTag。使用 \"tag36h11\" 标签族的 `这个在线 AprilTag 生成器 "
"<https://chaitanyantr.github.io/apriltag.html>`__ 已被成功使用。"

#: ../../source/docs/precision-landing-blueos.rst:27
#: 45f6ec3579b04eef8b4c932f6d44dede
msgid ""
"A :ref:`rangefinder <common-rangefinder-landingpage>` is also required."
msgstr "还需要一个 :ref:`测距仪 <common-rangefinder-landingpage>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/precision-landing-blueos.rst:30
#: 8dc8b924173c4e4ab2449ab9bdea3bb4
msgid "BlueOS Extension Installation"
msgstr "BlueOS 扩展安装"

#: ../../source/docs/precision-landing-blueos.rst:32
#: 38c2c106fc0e441b8115f2c536fd0128
msgid ""
"Once BlueOS has been :ref:`installed <dev:companion-computer-blueos>` on the"
" companion computer:"
msgstr "在机载计算机上完成 BlueOS 的 :ref:`安装 <dev:companion-computer-blueos>` 之后："

#: ../../source/docs/precision-landing-blueos.rst:34
#: 8bb06a62a9b34d60812ed48cad56d8e4
msgid "Ensure the companion computer is connected to the internet"
msgstr "确保机载计算机已连接互联网"

#: ../../source/docs/precision-landing-blueos.rst:35
#: 090707926b844dd2bdcc2abd90852337
msgid "From the left menu, select \"Extensions\""
msgstr "在左侧菜单中选择 \"Extensions\""

#: ../../source/docs/precision-landing-blueos.rst:36
#: f042b85d58d844388bf456bba56f8dd4
msgid "Search for \"precision landing\" and push the \"GET\" and \"INSTALL\" buttons"
msgstr "搜索 \"precision landing\"，然后依次点击 \"GET\" 和 \"INSTALL\" 按钮"

#: ../../source/docs/precision-landing-blueos.rst:42
#: 1d762cfb644a4442b86a528589ebaf4a
msgid "From the left menu, select \"Precision Landing\""
msgstr "在左侧菜单中选择 \"Precision Landing\""

#: ../../source/docs/precision-landing-blueos.rst:43
#: f661d9649ba74e069d06f38805232d99
msgid "Select the \"Camera Type\" being used"
msgstr "选择所使用的 \"Camera Type\""

#: ../../source/docs/precision-landing-blueos.rst:44
#: ce8f1796a2334f90b857f1c41ea3bc6a
msgid "Optionally adjust the \"Horizontal FOV\" to match the camera gimbal's lens"
msgstr "可选：调整 \"Horizontal FOV\" 以匹配相机云台的镜头"

#: ../../source/docs/precision-landing-blueos.rst:45
#: 05c41c3b085946efa418c9cbdaee7e4d
msgid ""
"Set the \"AprilTag Family\" and \"AprilTag ID\" to the values used when "
"printing the AprilTag"
msgstr "将 \"AprilTag Family\" 和 \"AprilTag ID\" 设置为打印 AprilTag 时使用的值"

#: ../../source/docs/precision-landing-blueos.rst:46
#: edd341491fce4e5f8a91e36b5c33b7af
msgid ""
"Optionally reduce the \"AprilTag Detection Quality\" to improve detection "
"speed at the cost of range (2 is normally a good value)"
msgstr "可选：降低 \"AprilTag Detection Quality\"，以牺牲探测距离为代价提高检测速度（2 通常是个不错的值）"

#: ../../source/docs/precision-landing-blueos.rst:47
#: cd974f0c5020497ea26a452ab2156ec4
msgid ""
"Leave \"Undistort Image\" unchecked unless a very high powered companion "
"computer is being used"
msgstr "除非使用性能非常强的机载计算机，否则保持 \"Undistort Image\" 不勾选"

#: ../../source/docs/precision-landing-blueos.rst:48
#: f9a527a4f93e4a8a9909e79402d15544
msgid ""
"\"Flight Controller SysID\" should match the vehicle's :ref:`MAV_SYSID "
"<MAV_SYSID>` parameter (normally 1)"
msgstr ""
"\"Flight Controller SysID\" 应与机体的 :ref:`MAV_SYSID <MAV_SYSID>` 参数一致（通常为 1）"

#: ../../source/docs/precision-landing-blueos.rst:49
#: 240234971cfa453c98e0d065b5720e16
msgid "Press \"Save Setting\" buttons"
msgstr "点击 \"Save Setting\" 按钮"

#: ../../source/docs/precision-landing-blueos.rst:55
#: a6251aabc1d34c7eb302d4a1dc92a00d
msgid ""
"Place the tag in front of the camera and press the \"Test Detection\" "
"button.  Within a few seconds an image from the camera should be displayed "
"with the AprilTag highlighted in red."
msgstr "将标签放在相机前并点击 \"Test Detection\" 按钮。几秒钟内应显示来自相机的图像，其中 AprilTag 以红色高亮标出。"

#: ../../source/docs/precision-landing-blueos.rst:56
#: 4036b406ce0a4e01a2c020665da64ab8
msgid ""
"Press the \"Run\" button to run the precision landing algorithm "
"continuously.  This is persistent meaning the algorithm will start "
"automatically if the companion computer is rebooted."
msgstr "点击 \"Run\" 按钮以持续运行精准降落算法。该设置是持久的，即机载计算机重启后算法会自动启动。"

#: ../../source/docs/precision-landing-blueos.rst:59
#: 93e4a94c0b4e4cab895e77ba38546632
msgid "AutoPilot Configuration"
msgstr "飞控配置"

#: ../../source/docs/precision-landing-blueos.rst:61
#: 5394a3d212354152976eb9856d762f3d
msgid "Set :ref:`PLND_ENABLED <PLND_ENABLED>` = 1 (Enabled)"
msgstr "设置 :ref:`PLND_ENABLED <PLND_ENABLED>` = 1（启用）"

#: ../../source/docs/precision-landing-blueos.rst:62
#: 6447024efd954c9f9f52f80c01764872
msgid "Set :ref:`PLND_TYPE <PLND_TYPE>` = 1 (MAVLink)"
msgstr "设置 :ref:`PLND_TYPE <PLND_TYPE>` = 1（MAVLink）"

#: ../../source/docs/precision-landing-blueos.rst:63
#: d5e598d954d449989e339dbd8f60043c
msgid ""
"To improve performance set the :ref:`PLND_CAM_POS_X <PLND_CAM_POS_X>`, "
":ref:`PLND_CAM_POS_Y <PLND_CAM_POS_Y>`, and :ref:`PLND_CAM_POS_Z "
"<PLND_CAM_POS_Z>` parameters.  For more details see the :ref:`sensor "
"position offsets <common-sensor-offset-compensation>` page."
msgstr ""
"为提高性能，请设置 :ref:`PLND_CAM_POS_X <PLND_CAM_POS_X>`、:ref:`PLND_CAM_POS_Y "
"<PLND_CAM_POS_Y>` 和 :ref:`PLND_CAM_POS_Z <PLND_CAM_POS_Z>` 参数。更多详情见 "
":ref:`传感器位置偏移 <common-sensor-offset-compensation>` 页面。"

#: ../../source/docs/precision-landing-blueos.rst:66
#: 8e04c187475044ed950813b67e0eed95
msgid "Flying and Testing"
msgstr "飞行与测试"

#: ../../source/docs/precision-landing-blueos.rst:68
#: 6e69421d5ed547789fff5a63cdf3d677
msgid ""
"Setup the vehicle with one of the flight modes set to RTL or Land mode."
msgstr "为机体设置好飞行模式，使其中一个飞行模式为 RTL 或 Land 模式。"

#: ../../source/docs/precision-landing-blueos.rst:70
#: 44770036723846069794d73509c08143
msgid ""
"Place the AprilTag on the ground and take-off to approximately 10m above the"
" target. Switch the vehicle to Land. If everything is working properly, the "
"copter should move toward the AprilTag."
msgstr ""
"将 AprilTag 放在地面上，起飞至目标上方约 10m 处。将机体切换到 Land 模式。如果一切正常，多旋翼应朝 AprilTag 移动。"

#: ../../source/docs/precision-landing-blueos.rst:76
#: dbd8326360c643eb9e38734eb3165aaf
msgid ""
"Be prepared to retake control in Stabilize, AltHold or Loiter if there are "
"sudden unexpected movements"
msgstr "如出现突然的意外动作，请做好切换到 Stabilize、AltHold 或 Loiter 重新接管控制的准备"

#: ../../source/docs/precision-landing-blueos.rst:78
#: 57e4112bf425423a8bfe232c8f0bd711
msgid ""
"If the vehicle does not behave appropriately, download the dataflash logs "
"and examine the PL messages."
msgstr "如果机体行为异常，请下载 dataflash 日志并检查 PL 消息。"

#: ../../source/docs/precision-landing-blueos.rst:80
#: b64e99984c0c44a6a00afb7206e3972d
msgid ""
"If the \"Heal\" (meaning health) field is not \"1\" then there may be a "
"communication issue between the autopilot and BlueOS"
msgstr "如果 \"Heal\"（即 health，健康状态）字段不是 \"1\"，则飞控与 BlueOS 之间可能存在通信问题"

#: ../../source/docs/precision-landing-blueos.rst:81
#: fea4d3ee8d834252b80c68ec34621783
msgid ""
"If the \"TAcq\" (meaning Target Acquired) field is not \"1\" then the sensor"
" is not seeing the target."
msgstr "如果\"TAcq\"（即目标已捕获）字段不为\"1\"，则传感器未检测到目标。"

#: ../../source/docs/precision-landing-blueos.rst:82
#: b473ebd60392487197ba865aae743b9a
msgid ""
"The pX, pY values show the horizontal distance to the target from the "
"vehicle."
msgstr "pX、pY值显示飞行器到目标的水平距离。"

#: ../../source/docs/precision-landing-blueos.rst:83
#: b7b24ee17fea44aa9f683c144fc12b8f
msgid ""
"The vX, vY values show the estimated velocity of the target relative to the "
"vehicle."
msgstr "vX、vY值显示目标相对于飞行器的估计速度。"
